{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Memories Off 2nd","Shirakawa Hotaru, a girl who's in love with Inami Ken, finally confesses her love. From there on, they were happy couples, until one summer. Ken met a new friend, Tobise Tomoe, who is Hotaru's best friend. Tomoe seems to have her own charm. Ken, now have two paths to choose from; to be with Shirakawa Hotaru or Tobise Tomoe. Otherwise, he will lose them both.\n\n\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"],"ja":["メモリーズオフ 2nd",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[{"id":361,"relation":"prequel"},{"id":363,"relation":"sequel"}],"id":"mal-362","ids":{"shikimori":362,"mal":362,"anilist":362,"kodik":"serial-29117"},"kodikIds":["serial-29117"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-29117":"2020-08-30T17:02:33Z"},"title":"Забыть прошлое 2","originalTitle":"Memories Off 2","alt":"Memories Off 2nd メモリーズオフ 2nd","description":"Хотару Сиракава давно влюблена в Кэна Инами и, наконец, признаётся ему в своей любви. С этого момента они становятся счастливой парой, пока одним летним днём Кэн не встречает Томоэ Тобисэ , как оказывается, лучшую подругу Хотару. Томоэ очень заинтересовывает Кэна. Теперь у него есть два пути — быть либо с Хотару, либо с Томоэ. Кэн должен выбрать только одну или потеряет их обоих.","year":2003,"type":"OVA","genres":["Драма","Романтика"],"rating":6.2,"popularity":1364,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[361,363],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/362/b6fd6ad779c8b117b4f93d27edd00ef7.jpeg","width":225,"height":300},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/system/screenshots/original/55cdf450104376b084f61f015f0d7835faf91f78.jpg","width":640,"height":480}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-740","dubId":"740","label":"ANIvoice","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-29117","trans